# Dispatchly

Open-source outbox messaging library. Do not add Blazor, MudBlazor, Identity, EF Core, DispatchR, or a web host. Aspire belongs only in `samples/Aspire`.

- `net10.0`, central package management, nullable, warnings as errors
- xUnit v3 with `Assert.*`. Do not add FluentAssertions
- PostgreSQL tests use Testcontainers and live in `Dispatchly.Transport.PostgreSql.Tests`
- SQL Server tests use Testcontainers and live in `Dispatchly.Transport.SqlServer.Tests`
- Public async methods take `CancellationToken` last
- Register one transport per host
- Delivery is at-least-once. Handlers must be idempotent. Durable idempotency commits handler writes on the delivery transaction with the message id
- Do not add `Co-authored-by` trailers to commits
